        "# H3 Ref2VA + Character Swap V1.5\nUpload Picture 1 and Video 1. Start with a short 24 fps video (about 5 seconds); native loading decodes the entire clip. Set output seconds and aspect ratio manually. H3 rounds length to supported frame counts, so exact source duration is not guaranteed.\n\nPower LoRA Loader: Character Swap V1.5 = 1.0, FL2V Turbo 8-step = 1.0. Sampling: er_sde, normal, 8 steps, CFG 1 (BasicGuider). Only these two LoRAs are enabled.\n\nCharacter Swap changes identity and may alter the body despite head-only wording; precise head isolation needs a mask/compositing workflow. Audio is generated, not an exact copy of source audio.\n\nBased on the latest Comfy-Org video_minimax_h3_r2v.json retrieved 2026-10-22. Uses original H3, not FastH3. Graph checked; no GPU generation test performed.\nSources: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/templates/video_minimax_h3_r2v.json and https://huggingface.co/akatz-ai/MiniMax-H3-Character-Swap-LoRA"
      ]
    }
  ],
